			<Comment>♂
・階段付近
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:43:31" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM
副館長（Assistant Director）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
