・GRIDX＝15、GRIDZ＝22、下向き
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:43:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>見物客その１
MAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
